#### [MOVE]
Move all other root `.md` files to their respective locations in `Docs v 3.0/`.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Verify that the root directory only contains 3-4 essential `.md` files.
2. Verify that all moved files are accessible and correctly categorized in `Docs v 3.0/`.
3. Verify that `DOCS_INDEX.md` and `GURUDEVI_STATUS.md` have working links (to the extent of the filesystem).
